  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sierra Leone Political Economy Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to assess the modern-day distribution of political power in Sierra Leone. The Political Economy Analysis will inform the Country Business Plan, in particular the realism, targeting and timeframe of its objectives, and the levers and the ways of working most likely to deliver them.</narrative>
  </description>
